mqtt_subscribe_failed.description:
Home Assistant's MQTT integration isn't connected, so SecuraCV can't hear your Canary devices on `{prefix}/#`.

To fix it: install the Mosquitto broker add-on (Settings > Add-ons > Add-on store > Mosquitto broker), then add the MQTT integration (Settings > Devices & Services > Add Integration > MQTT) and point it at that broker. Then reload the SecuraCV integration — this issue clears itself once the subscription succeeds.

